0..68 Comment "//! `forced` has a parent ask its task before it receives the reply."
69..72 Comment "//!"
73..149 Comment "//! The parent\'s send, the task\'s receipt and the task\'s reply form a chain."
150..207 Comment "//! Only the task close commutes with the parent receipt."
208..211 Comment "//!"
212..289 Comment "//! The annotations state the channel web. The parent forks the task, sends a"
290..330 Comment "//! request, reads the reply and closes."
331..334 Comment "//!"
335..415 Comment "//! - see: `independent.gandr` — two tasks whose plays do not order each other"
416..492 Comment "//! - see: #3338 — the run trace and the web a source states for a channel"
493..532 Comment "// The import gives the task protocols."
